fixture cam_teleport_corner
doc Camera review round 2: throw the ember up-left into the corner of a 100x40-tile room, run right 120 frames, teleport back into the corner, then jump
room test/cam_box_100x40
spawn 200 1248
frames 240
input
  0 U L toss
  1..120 R
  121 toss
  122..150 jump
end
expect
  at 121 event.teleport=1
end
